	700
)

draw_text_ext(
	330,
	120,
	"The world government police as much as they can, but when a situation is deemed too dangerous a pseudo-detective is called in to handle it.",
	24,
	700
)

draw_text_ext(
	330,
	200,
	"Armed with perception altering magical tools, a pseudo-detective can force any suspect to give out information. Thus they are feared and despised by those in the dungeon.",
